The shared base of Mantella Living World. Install it once, then add only the modules you want. Modules never need each other, only the hub.

[color=#888888]Mantella's default response length (max_tokens 250) can cut replies off once modules add their lines. If NPCs go quiet or stop mid-sentence, raise it to 500 in Mantella's LLM settings.[/color]

[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]MODULES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Module[/th][th]Adds[/th][th]Needs[/th][/tr][tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196850]Mantella Living World - OStim Expansion[/url][/td][td]Scene flows, scene talk, bystanders, favourite positions[/td][td]OStim Standalone[/td][/tr][tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196851]Mantella Living World - Arousal[/url][/td][td]Arousal, appetite, satisfied and overwhelmed[/td][td]OSL Aroused[/td][/tr][tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196852]Mantella Living World - Relationships[/url][/td][td]Marriage, shared history[/td][td]MARAS or Lover's Ledger[/td][/tr][tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196878]Mantella Living World - Followers[/url][/td][td]Join, leave, wait, follow, passive, wear this[/td][td]Nether's Follower Framework[/td][/tr][/table]
