[center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]WHAT THE HUB DOES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][table][tr][th]Feature[/th][th]Effect[/th][/tr][tr][td]Quiet outfits[/td][td]No equip / unequip spam in conversations during scenes, outfit changes and after loading screens[/td][/tr][tr][td]Temperament[/td][td]Reserved, bold or forward per NPC; set with a hotkey[/td][/tr][tr][td]Module status[/td][td]MCM page with a check for each installed module and supported mod[/td][/tr][tr][td]Troubleshooting[/td][td]Writes a report for bug reports; optional debug log[/td][/tr][tr][td]Settings[/td][td]One MCM page for the hub and its shared settings[/td][/tr][/table][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/30379]SKSE[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/13048]PapyrusUtil[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/53000]MCM Helper[/url][/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/83578]Papyrus MessageBox[/url][/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]BEFORE YOU START[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url] 0.14: install it and check that a normal conversation works.[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196214]Mantella - Direct AI Connect[/url]: install it below Mantella in MO2 and run its Setup Backend.cmd once (needs Python 3.11). Without it the stock Mantella.exe runs and Living World does nothing.[/*][*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url], then the modules you want.[/*][*]API key: your LLM service's key stays in GPT_SECRET_KEY.txt in the Mantella mod folder (in MO2, right-click Mantella, Open in Explorer). A key for another service goes in the file named on the Direct AI Connect page, next to it.[/*][*]Open Mantella's settings page (http://localhost:4999/ui in your browser, only while Mantella is running), go to the Actions tab and turn on Advanced Actions. Many Living World actions (bribe, persuade, marriage steps, positions, map marks and others) only work with it, and it needs a model that supports tool calling.[/*][*]Nothing happens? Living World Main Status in Mantella's settings page lists what is missing.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]INSTALLATION[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list=1]
[*]Install with your mod manager and enable the plugin.[/*][*]Add the modules you want, each from its own page.[/*][*]Run the setup when the game reminds you, or press the hotkey with nobody targeted.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]NOTES[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][list]
[*]Bug? MCM, page Troubleshooting: turn on the debug log, reproduce it, then Write report. Attach SKSE\Plugins\MantellaLivingWorld\report.txt and Mantella's logging.log.[/*][/list][center][size=5][font=Trebuchet MS][b][color=#93c47d]SOURCE AND LICENSE[/color][/b][/font][/size][/center][url=https://github.com/Abhisek571/Mantella-Living-World-Hub]GitHub[/url], GNU AGPL-3.0 (Mantella is AGPL-3.0). Unofficial, not endorsed by the authors of the mods it works with.

